elf_consist_ie/output/mvp_pilot_005/train.log`\n\n---\n\n## **2. PILOT_004 RESULTS (Temperature T=1.0)**\n\n**Checkpoint File: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/checkpoints/mvp_pilot_004_DONE_20260514T091040.json`**\n\n**NER (T=1.0) Metrics:**\n- Greedy F1: 0.6671\n- Oracle F1: 0.7756\n- Headroom: 0.1085\n- Fleiss Kappa mean: 0.4048\n- Soft Jaccard mean: 0.7008\n- **Full rho_sj: 0.3825** (PASS threshold ≥ 0.30)\n- Full rho_fk: 0.259\n- **SJ beats FK: YES (+0.1235 advantage, p=7e-20)**\n- Conditional rho_sj: 0.3762\n- Sample F1 % zero: 12.19%\n\n**RE (T=1.0) Metrics:**\n- Greedy F1: 0.4208\n- Oracle F1: 0.5882\n- Headroom: 0.1674\n- Fleiss Kappa mean: 0.2996\n- Soft Jaccard mean: 0.6114\n- **Full rho_sj: 0.2441** (FAIL - below 0.30 threshold)\n- Full rho_fk: 0.2782\n- **SJ beats FK: NO** (FK wins by 0.034 on full set)\n- **SJ beats FK on conditional: YES** (rho_sj=0.3161 vs rho_fk=0.3067, +0.0094)\n- Conditional rho_sj: 0.3161\n- Conditional n: 313 (vs 397 full)\n- Sample F1 % zero: 44.3%\n- Verdict: FAIL\n\n---\n\n## **3. PILOT_005 RESULTS (Temperature T=0.7) - IN PROGRESS**\n\n**Checkpoint File: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/checkpoints/mvp_pilot_005_RUNNING_20260514T091614.json`**\n\n**Status:** Currently RUNNING (started 2026-05-14T09:14:09, updated T09:16:14)\n- No metrics available yet (experiment still executing)\n- Expected outcomes: Testing whether T=0.7 improves RE rho_sj ≥ 0.30 by reducing RE zero rate\n- Configuration matches pilot_004 except temperature parameter\n- Command: `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python3 code/run_mvp_pilot.py --model_path checkpoints/qwen3-8b-scierc-merged-v2 --data_dir data/scierc/processed_data --dataset scierc --subtask joint --n_samples 8 --temperature 0.7 --max_tokens 1024 --output_dir output/mvp_pilot_005 --num_test 551 --seed 42 --tensor_parallel 1`\n\n---\n\n## **4. TEMPERATURE SENSITIVITY ANALYSIS FRAMEWORK**\n\n**File: `/home/ubu